## Answers in Gust's search to questions about dates and times.
## The answer itself, such as "157 days" or "17:00", is formatted for the language; these describe it.

gust-search-answer-until = До { $date }
gust-search-answer-since = С { $date }
gust-search-answer-between = Между { $from } и { $to }
gust-search-answer-time-ahead = { $place }, на { $hours ->
    [one] { $hours } час
    [few] { $hours } часа
    [many] { $hours } часов
   *[other] { $hours } часа
} вперёд
gust-search-answer-time-behind = { $place }, на { $hours ->
    [one] { $hours } час
    [few] { $hours } часа
    [many] { $hours } часов
   *[other] { $hours } часа
} назад
gust-search-answer-time-same = { $place }, то же время, что и здесь
gust-search-answer-converted = { $place }, когда { $time } ({ $from })
gust-search-answer-converted-here = Здесь, когда { $time } ({ $from })
gust-search-answer-converted-from-here = { $place }, когда здесь { $time }

